><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></p><time>Nov 9, 2026</time></header><figure class="W1FydW_featuredFigure"><div class="W1FydW_media"><div class="TSxPAa_e-videoEmbed W1FydW_video"><div class="_BfwWW_cover"><img alt="Video thumbnail" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://assets.claude.com/3897bb01a63f2f5c37325d6fe22af6746f1964f4.jpg?w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 1x, https://assets.claude.com/3897bb01a63f2f5c37325d6fe22af6746f1964f4.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 2x" src="https://assets.claude.com/3897bb01a63f2f5c37325d6fe22af6746f1964f4.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max"/><button aria-label="Play video" data-component="Button" data-variant="tertiary" class="f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-tertiary f9ZZrG_size-large f9ZZrG_icon-format-icon-only _BfwWW_playButton"><span class="f9ZZrG_icon"><svg class="lqbdHG_icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18"><path d="M3.59961 3.6418C3.59986 2.58403 4.76149 1.93696 5.66066 2.49394L14.303 7.85268C15.1543 8.38061 15.1542 9.61864 14.303 10.1466L5.66066 15.5054C4.8175 16.0278 3.74356 15.4919 3.61279 14.5509L3.59961 14.3575V3.6418ZM5.18692 3.25947C4.88726 3.07384 4.49987 3.28934 4.49962 3.6418V14.3575L4.50401 14.4226C4.54786 14.736 4.90598 14.914 5.18692 14.7399L13.8284 9.38199C14.1121 9.20596 14.1122 8.79328 13.8284 8.61734L5.18692 3.25947Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></figure><a class="W1FydW_tileLink" href="/claude-fable-and-mythos-5-2"><h2 class="tOQyXa_headline-3 W1FydW_featuredTitle" data-component="Headline">Introducing Claude Fable 5.2 and Claude Mythos 5.2</h2><p class="tOQyXa_body-3 W1FydW_featuredSummary" data-component="Body">Our most capable models for daunting technical work, Claude Fable 5.2 and Claude Mythos 5.2 set a new bar in coding, finance, and the sciences.</p></a></article><div class="W1FydW_column W1FydW_left"><article class="W1FydW_tile"><header class="nUeDbq_header W1FydW_header"><div class="nUeDbq_headerButton"><button aria-label="Related to Investing in the public benefit" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed" type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3qlq75fiv9kcnnb_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></p><time>Oct 18, 2026</time></header><a class="W1FydW_media W1FydW_mediaLink" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" href="/news/public-benefit-fund"><img alt="Investing in the public benefit" loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1125" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="W1FydW_mediaImage" style="color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 25vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://assets.claude.com/eed596be48a4b322690a6175794cdbd970ec4df4.jpg?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 256w, https://assets.claude.com/eed596be48a4b322690a6175794cdbd970ec4df4.jpg?w=384&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 384w, https://assets.claude.com/eed596be48a4b322690a6175794cdbd970ec4df4.jpg?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 640w, https://assets.claude.com/eed596be48a4b322690a6175794cdbd970ec4df4.jpg?w=750&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 750w, https://assets.claude.com/eed596be48a4b322690a6175794cdbd970ec4df4.jpg?w=828&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 828w, https://assets.claude.com/eed596be48a4b322690a6175794cdbd970ec4df4.jpg?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 1080w, https://assets.claude.com/eed596be48a4b322690a6175794cdbd970ec4df4.jpg?w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 1200w, https://assets.claude.com/eed596be48a4b322690a6175794cdbd970ec4df4.jpg?w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 1920w, https://assets.claude.com/eed596be48a4b322690a6175794cdbd970ec4df4.jpg?w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 2048w, https://assets.claude.com/eed596be48a4b322690a6175794cdbd970ec4df4.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max 3840w" src="https://assets.claude.com/eed596be48a4b322690a6175794cdbd970ec4df4.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp&amp;fit=max"/></a><a class="W1FydW_tileLink" href="/news/public-benefit-fund"><h3 class="tOQyXa_headline-5 W1FydW_tileTitle" data-component="Headline">Investing in the public benefit</h3><p class="tOQyXa_body-4 W1FydW_summary" data-component="Body">We’re committing a portion of Anthropic’s shares to the Anthropic Public Benefit Fund, a new entity with a structure that increases the stake as the company grows.</p></a></article><article class="W1FydW_tile"><header class="nUeDbq_header W1FydW_header"><div class="nUeDbq_headerButton"><button aria-label="Related to Anthropic files S-1 with the SEC for proposed initial public offering" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed" type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3qpq75fiv9kcnnb_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></p><time>Oct 26, 2026</time></header><a class="W1FydW_tileLink" href="/news/s1-sec"><h3 class="tOQyXa_headline-5 W1FydW_tileTitle" data-component="Headline">Anthropic files S-1 with the SEC for proposed initial public offering</h3><p class="tOQyXa_body-4 W1FydW_summary" data-component="Body">Today, Anthropic, PBC filed a registration statement on Form S-1 with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission relating to its proposed initial public offering of its Class A common stock.</p></a></article></div><div class="W1FydW_column W1FydW_right"><article class="W1FydW_tile"><header class="nUeDbq_header W1FydW_header"><div class="nUeDbq_headerButton"><button aria-label="Related to Early progress on accelerating drug development with Claude" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed" type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3qma75fiv9kcnnb_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/science">Science</a></p><time>Oct 27, 2026</time></header><a class="W1FydW_tileLink" href="/research/early-progress-drug-development"><h3 class="tOQyXa_headline-5 W1FydW_tileTitle" data-component="Headline">Early progress on accelerating drug development with Claude</h3><p class="tOQyXa_body-4 W1FydW_summary" data-component="Body">We&#x27;re at the start of a major effort to speed up drug development with Claude. Over the past several months, our scientists have engaged in deep research partnerships with six organizations developing new medicines.</p></a></article><article class="W1FydW_tile"><header class="nUeDbq_header W1FydW_header"><div class="nUeDbq_headerButton"><button aria-label="Related to Introducing Claude Haiku 5.5" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed" type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3qqa75fiv9kcnnb_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></p><time>Oct 7, 2026</time></header><a class="W1FydW_tileLink" href="/claude-haiku-5-5"><h3 class="tOQyXa_headline-5 W1FydW_tileTitle" data-component="Headline">Introducing Claude Haiku 5.5</h3><p class="tOQyXa_body-4 W1FydW_summary" data-component="Body">Claude Haiku 5.5 is our fastest, most capable small model. Built for high-volume work like summarization, subagents, and browser use.</p></a></article><article class="W1FydW_tile"><header class="nUeDbq_header W1FydW_header"><div class="nUeDbq_headerButton"><button aria-label="Related to Introducing Claude Opus 5.5" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed" type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_3qua75fiv9kcnnb_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></p><time>Sep 22, 2026</time></header><a class="W1FydW_tileLink" href="/claude-opus-5-5"><h3 class="tOQyXa_headline-5 W1FydW_tileTitle" data-component="Headline">Introducing Claude Opus 5.5</h3><p class="tOQyXa_body-4 W1FydW_summary" data-component="Body">Claude Opus 5.5 leads in agentic coding and knowledge work, and costs 40% less to run than Opus 5 on typical workloads.</p></a></article></div></div></div></section><section class="ZSMdoa_root ZSMdoa_flushTop" data-theme="ivory"><div class="_5NNTzG_top-bar-frame"><div class="tOQyXa_caption-1 tOQyXa_weight--bold EotmOW_root _5NNTzG_top-bar" data-component="FeaturedEyebrow">Features</div></div><div class="_5NNTzG_inset-frame"><div class="_5NNTzG_hero-carousel _5NNTzG_unthemed _5NNTzG_inset" style="visibi