false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="91aeb467-00d1-44c4-b6d9-27a22689d00d"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/claude-fable-and-mythos-5-2"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Introducing Claude Fable 5.2 and Claude Mythos 5.2</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/claude-fable-and-mythos-5-2"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>Our most capable models for daunting technical work, Claude Fable 5.2 and Claude Mythos 5.2 set a new bar in coding, finance, and the sciences.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Nov 9, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Introducing Claude Fable 5.2 and Claude Mythos 5.2 details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Nov 9, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/claude-fable-and-mythos-5-2"><h3>Introducing Claude Fable 5.2 and Claude Mythos 5.2</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/claude-fable-and-mythos-5-2"><p>Our most capable models for daunting technical work, Claude Fable 5.2 and Claude Mythos 5.2 set a new bar in coding, finance, and the sciences.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Introducing Claude Fable 5.2 and Claude Mythos 5.2" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="0c98d5f1-9776-47c3-ae13-49c06cf21cce"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">AI for Science expands to foundations and research institutions</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>We’re highlighting 20 scientific foundations, institutions, and research groups around the world that we’ve partnered with in an expansion of our AI for Science program.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 28, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="AI for Science expands to foundations and research institutions details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 28, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions"><h3>AI for Science expands to foundations and research institutions</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions"><p>We’re highlighting 20 scientific foundations, institutions, and research groups around the world that we’ve partnered with in an expansion of our AI for Science program.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for AI for Science expands to foundations and research institutions" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="3e2c219b-247b-4ed5-8d74-4f60351b96b5"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/expanding-partnership-gsa"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Expanding our partnership with GSA to bring Claude to all levels of government</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/expanding-partnership-gsa"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>We are expanding our partnership with the General Services Administration (GSA) through a new agreement that gives government partners a 40% discount on Claude Enterprise, Claude for Government, and the Claude API. </p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/partnerships">Partnerships</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 27, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Expanding our partnership with GSA to bring Claude to all levels of government details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 27, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/partnerships">Partnerships</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/expanding-partnership-gsa"><h3>Expanding our partnership with GSA to bring Claude to all levels of government</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/expanding-partnership-gsa"><p>We are expanding our partnership with the General Services Administration (GSA) through a new agreement that gives government partners a 40% discount on Claude Enterprise, Claude for Government, and the Claude API. </p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Expanding our partnership with GSA to bring Claude to all levels of government" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="bd7e485c-6e8a-47c3-91b4-722a089a344c"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/s1-sec"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Anthropic files S-1 with the SEC for proposed initial public offering</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/s1-sec"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>Today, Anthropic, PBC filed a registration statement on Form S-1 with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission relating to its proposed initial public offering of its Class A common stock.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 26, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Anthropic files S-1 with the SEC for proposed initial public offering details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 26, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/s1-sec"><h3>Anthropic files S-1 with the SEC for proposed initial public offering</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/s1-sec"><p>Today, Anthropic, PBC filed a registration statement on Form S-1 with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission relating to its proposed initial public offering of its Class A common stock.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Anthropic files S-1 with the SEC for proposed initial public offering" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="7911e2a1-c66c-4d5a-9871-3ba1e072f006"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Donating Agent Skills to the Agentic AI Foundation</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>We’re donating Agent Skills, the open standard that gives AI agents specialized knowledge and workflows, to the Agentic AI Foundation. More than 70 agent platforms, including ChatGPT, Cursor, GitHub Copilot, and VS Code, have integrated Agent Skills since we published the standard in December 2025. </p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/product">Product</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 22, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Donating Agent Skills to the Agentic AI Foundation details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 22, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/product">Product</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation"><h3>Donating Agent Skills to the Agentic AI Foundation</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation"><p>We’re donating Agent Skills, the open standard that gives AI agents specialized knowledge and workflows, to the Agentic AI Foundation. More than 70 agent platforms, including ChatGPT, Cursor, GitHub Copilot, and VS Code, have integrated Agent Skills since we published the standard in December 2025. </p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Donating Agent Skills to the Agentic AI Foundation" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="41616044-a355-43df-9795-157a49022593"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/open-call-guest-investigators-life-sciences"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Open call for guest investigators in the life sciences</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/open-call-guest-investigators-life-sciences"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>Today, we’re inviting members of the life sciences community to apply to work with us on special projects.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 22, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Open call for guest investigators in the life sciences details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 22, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/open-call-guest-investigators-life-sciences"><h3>Open call for guest investigators in the life sciences</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/open-call-guest-investigators-life-sciences"><p>Today, we’re inviting members of the life sciences community to apply to work with us on special projects.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Open call for guest investigators in the life sciences" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="ee8cbf20-dfe2-4472-a695-7e17572a6ac3"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/christopher-stubbs-joins-long-term-benefit-trust"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Physicist Christopher Stubbs joins Anthropic&#x27;s Long-Term Benefit Trust</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/christopher-stubbs-joins-long-term-benefit-trust"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>Dr. Christopher Stubbs, an experimental physicist and former Dean of Science at Harvard University, has joined Anthropic’s Long-Term Benefit Trust. He brings to the Trust decades of scientific expertise across observational cosmology and precision measurement. </p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 21, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Physicist Christopher Stubbs joins Anthropic&#x27;s Long-Term Benefit Trust details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 21, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/christopher-stubbs-joins-long-term-benefit-trust"><h3>Physicist Christopher Stubbs joins Anthropic&#x27;s Long-Term Benefit Trust</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/christopher-stubbs-joins-long-term-benefit-trust"><p>Dr. Christopher Stubbs, an experimental physicist and former Dean of Science at Harvard University, has joined Anthropic’s Long-Term Benefit Trust. He brings to the Trust decades of scientific expertise across observational cosmology and precision measurement. </p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Physicist Christopher Stubbs joins Anthropic&#x27;s Long-Term Benefit Trust" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="article-53b11e2c-4b49-4696-b4e2-b98fa66c3131"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/public-benefit-fund"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Investing in the public benefit</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/public-benefit-fund"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>We’re committing a portion of Anthropic’s shares to the Anthropic Public Benefit Fund, a new entity with a structure that increases the stake as the company grows.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 18, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Investing in the public benefit details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 18, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/public-benefit-fund"><h3>Investing in the public benefit</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/public-benefit-fund"><p>We’re committing a portion of Anthropic’s shares to the Anthropic Public Benefit Fund, a new entity with a structure that increases the stake as the company grows.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Investing in the public benefit" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="article-c0946ebf-c32f-4e3e-a31e-d524a1360ba5"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/an-update-on-independent-evaluators"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">An update on independent evaluators</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/an-update-on-independent-evaluators"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>To evaluate the safety of our systems, Anthropic is giving employee-like access to a team from METR, a nonprofit that evaluates frontier AI models, and we&#x27;re in early discussions with several other organizations, including Hugging Face.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/policy">Policy</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 15, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="An update on independent evaluators details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 15, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/policy">Policy</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/an-update-on-independent-evaluators"><h3>An update on independent evaluators</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/an-update-on-independent-evaluators"><p>To evaluate the safety of our systems, Anthropic is giving employee-like access to a team from METR, a nonprofit that evaluates frontier AI models, and we&#x27;re in early discussions with several other organizations, including Hugging Face.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for An update on independent evaluators" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="article-fcf822f7-4a95-4719-a5d4-44925a79084e"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/2026-us-midterms"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Preparing for the 2026 US midterms</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/2026-us-midterms"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>Earlier this year, we shared an update on our election safeguards. Here, we outline how we’ve continued to strengthen these safeguards ahead of this year’s US midterms.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/safeguards">Safeguards</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 14, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Preparing for the 2026 US midterms details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 14, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/safeguards">Safeguards</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/2026-us-midterms"><h3>Preparing for the 2026 US midterms</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/2026-us-midterms"><p>Earlier this year, we shared an update on our election safeguards. Here, we outline how we’ve continued to strengthen these safeguards ahead of this year’s US midterms.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Preparing for the 2026 US midterms" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="article-c2e6e0e0-2118-4015-9d83-8192c0c3b8f7"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/singapore-office-opening"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Anthropic opens Singapore office and signs MOU with the Government of Singapore</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/singapore-office-opening"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>Anthropic has opened an office in Singapore and signed an MOU with the country’s government to advance safe, responsible AI adoption.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 14, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Anthropic opens Singapore office and signs MOU with the Government of Singapore details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 14, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/singapore-office-opening"><h3>Anthropic opens Singapore office and signs MOU with the Government of Singapore</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/singapore-office-opening"><p>Anthropic has opened an office in Singapore and signed an MOU with the country’s government to advance safe, responsible AI adoption.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Anthropic opens Singapore office and signs MOU with the Government of Singapore" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="article-3031d0a4-7533-449a-9fec-9f313f7d750b"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/distillation-defenses"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Strengthening our defenses against distillation attacks</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/distillation-defenses"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>Illicit distillation allows model developers to copy frontier AI capabilities without creating proportionally robust safeguards. Here, we describe how we’ve reduced the rate of distillation by more than 90%.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/safeguards">Safeguards</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 12, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Strengthening our defenses against distillation attacks details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 12, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/safeguards">Safeguards</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/distillation-defenses"><h3>Strengthening our defenses against distillation attacks</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/distillation-defenses"><p>Illicit distillation allows model developers to copy frontier AI capabilities without creating proportionally robust safeguards. Here, we describe how we’ve reduced the rate of distillation by more than 90%.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Strengthening our defenses against distillation attacks" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="article-7cba0a10-5098-4b57-b348-e7e01d6e8386"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/anthropic-cyber-mission"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Introducing the Anthropic Cyber Mission</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/anthropic-cyber-mission"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>We’re launching the Anthropic Cyber Mission, a long-term commitment to securing the systems everyone depends on.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/security">Security</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 8, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Introducing the Anthropic Cyber Mission details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 8, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/security">Security</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/anthropic-cyber-mission"><h3>Introducing the Anthropic Cyber Mission</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/anthropic-cyber-mission"><p>We’re launching the Anthropic Cyber Mission, a long-term commitment to securing the systems everyone depends on.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Introducing the Anthropic Cyber Mission" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="article-3e5bfab5-0ff9-4ab7-9ce5-e78aef4160b5"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/2026-usage-policy-update"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">2026 Usage Policy update</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/2026-usage-policy-update"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>We’re publishing a new version of our Usage Policy. In this post, we summarize the changes we’ve made.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/policy">Policy</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 8, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="2026 Usage Policy update details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 8, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/policy">Policy</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/2026-usage-policy-update"><h3>2026 Usage Policy update</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/2026-usage-policy-update"><p>We’re publishing a new version of our Usage Policy. In this post, we summarize the changes we’ve made.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for 2026 Usage Policy update" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="article-1cb727f1-f1f1-4e2c-bd75-6130c4e5fa93"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/genesis-mission-commitment"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Building on our commitment to American scientific discovery</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/genesis-mission-commitment"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>Anthropic is committing $150 million over three years to the Genesis Mission, a federal initiative to accelerate scientific and technological discovery through AI. </p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/partnerships">Partnerships</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 8, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Building on our commitment to American scientific discovery details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 8, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/partnerships">Partnerships</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/genesis-mission-commitment"><h3>Building on our commitment to American scientific discovery</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/genesis-mission-commitment"><p>Anthropic is committing $150 million over three years to the Genesis Mission, a federal initiative to accelerate scientific and technological discovery through AI. </p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Building on our commitment to American scientific discovery" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="359be74f-ed1f-4d95-b3c6-d425a22b6469"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/claude-haiku-5-5"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Introducing Claude Haiku 5.5</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/claude-haiku-5-5"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>Claude Haiku 5.5 is our fastest, most capable small model. Built for high-volume work like summarization, subagents, and browser use.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 7, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Introducing Claude Haiku 5.5 details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 7, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/claude-haiku-5-5"><h3>Introducing Claude Haiku 5.5</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/claude-haiku-5-5"><p>Claude Haiku 5.5 is our fastest, most capable small model. Built for high-volume work like summarization, subagents, and browser use.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Introducing Claude Haiku 5.5" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="article-614ece6a-ece9-4795-b879-75d6fab690f4"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/cyber-verification-program"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Expanding the Cyber Verification Program</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/cyber-verification-program"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>We’re launching a new, expanded version of our Cyber Verification Program, which makes advanced cyber capabilities and reduced blocking classifiers available to qualifying security professionals.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 6, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Expanding the Cyber Verification Program details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 6, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/cyber-verification-program"><h3>Expanding the Cyber Verification Program</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/cyber-verification-program"><p>We’re launching a new, expanded version of our Cyber Verification Program, which makes advanced cyber capabilities and reduced blocking classifiers available to qualifying security professionals.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Expanding the Cyber Verification Program" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="article-8ffb55ab-b3c3-4655-995e-aa7e71619fe6"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/claude-frontier-academy"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Anthropic invests $100 million to train 10,000 engineers and tackle the enterprise AI talent gap</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/claude-frontier-academy"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>Anthropic is investing $100 million in Claude Frontier Academy to train 10,000 Frontier Deployed Engineers by the end of 2027, with cohorts from Accenture, Bain, CBA, Deloitte, McKinsey, Morgan Stanley and Novo Nordisk already underway.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 2, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Anthropic invests $100 million to train 10,000 engineers and tackle the enterprise AI talent gap details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 2, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/claude-frontier-academy"><h3>Anthropic invests $100 million to train 10,000 engineers and tackle the enterprise AI talent gap</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/claude-frontier-academy"><p>Anthropic is investing $100 million in Claude Frontier Academy to train 10,000 Frontier Deployed Engineers by the end of 2027, with cohorts from Accenture, Bain, CBA, Deloitte, McKinsey, Morgan Stanley and Novo Nordisk already underway.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Anthropic invests $100 million to train 10,000 engineers and tackle the enterprise AI talent gap" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="article-9a420b69-7d8b-484a-b70d-d9a673b20823"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/barclays-scales-claude"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Barclays scales Claude to upgrade operations and improve client experience </h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/barclays-scales-claude"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>Barclays, the British universal bank, is expanding its strategic collaboration with Anthropic to integrate secure, enterprise-grade AI systems across its global operations.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Oct 1, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Barclays scales Claude to upgrade operations and improve client experience  details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Oct 1, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/barclays-scales-claude"><h3>Barclays scales Claude to upgrade operations and improve client experience </h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/barclays-scales-claude"><p>Barclays, the British universal bank, is expanding its strategic collaboration with Anthropic to integrate secure, enterprise-grade AI systems across its global operations.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Barclays scales Claude to upgrade operations and improve client experience " class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="c3335a75-70b2-4872-bec2-50c854d0d302"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/claude-sonnet-5-5"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Introducing Claude Sonnet 5.5</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/claude-sonnet-5-5"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>Claude Sonnet 5.5 is a clear upgrade over Claude Sonnet 5, runs 30%+ faster, and costs up to 30% less for most work.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Sep 28, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Introducing Claude Sonnet 5.5 details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Sep 28, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/claude-sonnet-5-5"><h3>Introducing Claude Sonnet 5.5</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/claude-sonnet-5-5"><p>Claude Sonnet 5.5 is a clear upgrade over Claude Sonnet 5, runs 30%+ faster, and costs up to 30% less for most work.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Introducing Claude Sonnet 5.5" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="c17dc7c5-1812-4265-9ace-e7b2370aac87"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/claude-opus-5-5"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">Introducing Claude Opus 5.5</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/claude-opus-5-5"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>Claude Opus 5.5 leads in agentic coding and knowledge work, and costs 40% less to run than Opus 5 on typical workloads.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Sep 22, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="Introducing Claude Opus 5.5 details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Sep 22, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/announcements">Announcements</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/claude-opus-5-5"><h3>Introducing Claude Opus 5.5</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/claude-opus-5-5"><p>Claude Opus 5.5 leads in agentic coding and knowledge work, and costs 40% less to run than Opus 5 on typical workloads.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for Introducing Claude Opus 5.5" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="e345e490-490d-444d-8ad6-c7abf9cb3399"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/features/ebola-response"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium">The Situation Report</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/features/ebola-response"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>A rare Ebola strain is spreading in the DRC, with no confirmed vaccine. Global health organizations are using Claude to respond as fast as possible.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/features">Features</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Sep 21, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label="The Situation Report details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Sep 21, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/features">Features</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/features/ebola-response"><h3>The Situation Report</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/features/ebola-response"><p>A rare Ebola strain is spreading in the DRC, with no confirmed vaccine. Global health organizations are using Claude to respond as fast as possible.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for The Situation Report" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li><li class="bxgyUW_row" data-listing-row="article-9bd7f49d-be95-4433-b17a-4418580b2f08"><div class="_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander" data-expanded="false"><div class="bxgyUW_summary" data-peek="true"><div class="bxgyUW_title"><a class="bxgyUW_title-link" href="/news/accenture-embedded-evaluation"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><h3 class="font-medium"> Partnering with Accenture on embedded evaluation</h3></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_description"><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_above-link" href="/news/accenture-embedded-evaluation"><span class="mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning" data-progress="init"><span class="mpFHfW_nowrapText" style="transform:none"><p>We’re partnering with Accenture on independent evaluation of frontier AI—part of our recent commitment to embed evaluators at Anthropic. Both we and Accenture expect to invest at least $1 billion to build capacity in this area over the next five years.</p></span></span></a></div><div class="bxgyUW_category"><a class="wN10Da_link bxgyUW_above-link bxgyUW_category-link" href="/news/partnerships">Partnerships</a></div><div class="bxgyUW_date"><time>Sep 18, 2026</time></div></div><div class="bxgyUW_details" aria-hidden="true" inert="" role="region" aria-label=" Partnering with Accenture on embedded evaluation details"><div class="bxgyUW_details-meta"><div>Sep 18, 2026</div><div><a class="wN10Da_link" href="/news/partnerships">Partnerships</a></div></div><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-title" href="/news/accenture-embedded-evaluation"><h3> Partnering with Accenture on embedded evaluation</h3></a><a tabindex="-1" class="bxgyUW_details-description" href="/news/accenture-embedded-evaluation"><p>We’re partnering with Accenture on independent evaluation of frontier AI—part of our recent commitment to embed evaluators at Anthropic. Both we and Accenture expect to invest at least $1 billion to build capacity in this area over the next five years.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label="Show details for  Partnering with Accenture on embedded evaluation" class="hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></li></ul></div><div class="Q47Mqq_pagination"><button data-component="Button" data-variant="secondary" class="f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-secondary f9ZZrG_size-small f9ZZrG_icon-format-trailing">See more<span class="f9ZZrG_icon"><svg width="20" height=